  "title": "Bocconcini Salad",
  "description": "Bite-size balls of fresh mozzarella, known as bocconcini, make up this great salad made with cherry tomatoes, bell pepper, arugula, and fresh basil. It&#39;s a version of the popular &#39;insalata caprese.&#39;",
